swim\">\n        <span class=\"thumb-cut\"><span class=\"thumb-host\" data-fam=\"TAR\" data-seed=\"0.31\"></span></span>\n        <b class=\"lp\">Nightswim</b><small>A♭ MIN · 124</small>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"thumb\" data-coat=\"kiln\" title=\"Kiln\">\n        <span class=\"thumb-cut\"><span class=\"thumb-host\" data-fam=\"MOLTEN\" data-seed=\"0.77\"></span></span>\n        <b class=\"lp\">Kiln</b><small>E MIN · 140</small>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"thumb\" data-coat=\"chrome\" title=\"Chrome Country\">\n        <span class=\"thumb-cut\"><span class=\"thumb-host\" data-fam=\"CHROME\" data-seed=\"0.12\"></span></span>\n        <b class=\"lp\">Chrome Country</b><small>C MAJ · 118</small>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ── composer with the die-cut window ── -->\n  <div class=\"bi-composer\">\n    <div class=\"c-left\">\n      <div class=\"ask\" id=\"ask\">\n        <input id=\"askIn\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Ask Mosh to…\" aria-label=\"Ask Mosh\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\">\n        <button class=\"a-mic\" id=\"btnMic\" aria-label=\"Talk to Mosh\" title=\"Talk to Mosh\">\n          <svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"1.5\" width=\"4\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3 7a4 4 0 0 0 8 0M7 11v1.6\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"a-send\" id=\"btnSend\" aria-label=\"Send\" title=\"Send\">\n          <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M7 12V2.6M3.2 6.2 7 2.4l3.8 3.8\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <i class=\"a-prog\" id=\"prog\"></i>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"chips\">\n        <button class=\"chip\">Finish the hook</button>\n        <button class=\"chip\">Re-imagine the drums</button>\n        <button class=\"chip\">